NAME
    mute - mute or unmute one audio channel

SYNOPSIS
    mute <index> <on|off>

DESCRIPTION
    Excludes or restores audio channel <index> in the final audio mix.
    The channel's internal playback and envelope state continues to
    advance normally while muted. Pair with channels(1) to identify and
    isolate individual voices.

EXAMPLES
    mute 2 on
    mute 2 off

EXIT STATUS
    0   Channel mute state updated (or usage message printed).
    1   No target attached, invalid index, or session service fault.

SEE ALSO
    channels(1), regs(1)
